{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Backend_intf.Constant_key</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"arrayjit","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ir","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Backend_intf","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Constant_key","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>The key of a device's constant cache (gh-ocannl-1654). A node every routine of a compile only reads, and that is not <code>context_owned</code>, lives in a constant pool that outlives the context that allocated it, until the last release unit binding it is released (<code>field-device.constant_owners</code>). A host-initialized literal (<a href=\"../../Host_inits/index.html\"><code>Host_inits</code></a>) is <code>Shared</code>: one buffer per device, uploaded once, which every root on the device binds while any of them holds it. Any other such node -- a data input, a zero-valid accumulator -- is <code>Rooted</code> under the <code>field-context.constant_root</code> of the independently created context that allocated it, so compile siblings and descendants of one root share it while another root gets a buffer of its own: a write in one root can never change what another root reads.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-T\"><a href=\"#module-T\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"T/index.html\">T</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-include\"><details open=\"open\"><summary class=\"spec include\"><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <a href=\"T/index.html\">T</a> <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></summary><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = <a href=\"T/index.html#type-t\">T.t</a></span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.Shared\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.Shared\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Shared</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <a href=\"../../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a></span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.Rooted\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.Rooted\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Rooted</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int * <a href=\"../../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a></span></code></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hash_fold_t\"><a href=\"#val-hash_fold_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hash_fold_t : \u000A  <span><span class=\"xre